  "body": "Stress-free, easy-care living in an enviable seaside setting.\r\n\r\nPerfect for downsizers, professional couples, or small families,  or those simply wanting more time to enjoy life and less time maintaining a home. This tastefully  designed three-level residence makes coastal living wonderfully easy.\r\n\r\nWith a private lift connecting all three levels, every part of the home is effortlessly accessible.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor provides a generous single garage, excellent storage and direct access to a private afternoon patio - the perfect spot to unwind.\r\n\r\nThe middle level is ideal for family or guests, with two bedrooms, a family bathroom and a separate lounge, complemented by lovely sea views.\r\n\r\nUpstairs is where the home truly comes alive. The spacious master bedroom enjoys its own ensuite, while the light-filled open-plan kitchen and living area faces expansive, ever-changing sea views.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n* Freehold title - no body corporate fees.\r\n* Approximately 190sqm floor area on a 132sqm site.\r\n* 3 bedrooms | 2.5 bathrooms.\r\n* Designer kitchen with Miele appliances.\r\n* Kohler tapware & Villeroy & Boch bathroom fittings.\r\n* Central air conditioning.\r\n* Fully fenced, low-maintenance backyard.\r\n \r\nLock the door, leave the maintenance behind and make the most of the coastal lifestyle.",
